# Protocol

Purpose:
  Universal protocol layer. Defines rules, vocabulary, stages, states,
  relations, and origins that govern the entire SDDRA system.
  This layer is above all project-specific content.

Owns: ./

ReadOrder:
   1 @INDEX.sdd
   2 @ROOT.sdd (universal rules)

Rules:
  [PR1] Protocol rules are immutable unless explicitly changed.
  [PR2] All project-specific content must comply with protocol.
  [PR3] Protocol changes require human approval.

Navigation:
  Root: @ROOT.sdd

State: +
